ienced substantial tidal disruption."" (Ji2021 (arXiv 2106.12656v2), main-arxiv.tex l.132) | ""the distance gradient observed in the RRL star population agrees quite well with the expectations from the disruption model of Ant 2 developed by \citet{Ji21}"" (Vivas2022 (arXiv 2112.08467v1), main_arXiv.tex l.270)",hi_upper_limit_5sigma,7.69,0.37,0.4,,66.3,124.165,679204.0,1.874,1.2512,3.9281,0.0,absent (measured limit),4.6,4.6,0.0,,,0.0,0.0,,,0.0,multi_epoch_stated
