.tex l.203) | ""The alignment of \BooI's elongation, orbit, and velocity gradient, ... support previous arguments that \BooI\ is undergoing tidal disruption---or has at least experienced tidal deformation as a result of its repeated pericentric passages"" (Sandford2026 (arXiv 2509.02546v1), SandfordS5BooI.tex l.1128-1129 (summary))",rh_semimajor_assumed mv_distance_from_table1 hi_upper_limit_5sigma,4.0,0.3,0.4,,9.75145,66.3743,22537.8,1.931,1.2639,3.7389,0.0,absent (measured limit),0.23382685902179845,0.23382685902179845,0.25,0.02,0.02,1.0,1.0,2.401,2.491,0.0,multi_epoch_stated
