s consistently favor active tidal stripping."" (Li2026 (arXiv 2607.07803v1), main.tex l.519 (conclusions))",mv_distance_independent hi_upper_limit_5sigma source_preprint_sigma_distance_feh,1.69,0.85,1.03,,33.03,48.5289,18197.0,1.931,1.2605,3.7389,0.0,absent (measured limit),2.4,2.59,0.0,,,0.0,0.0,1.97,2.054,-2.0,not_stated
